1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Why did you come?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
I think... I want to be forgiven

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
more than anything

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
By whom?

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
I never blamed you

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
not once

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
You came for me

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
that's all that matters

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
How many sleepless nights must we count

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Before we finally arrive?

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
How many lives must be lost

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Before the fighting comes to an end?

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Just helpless clowns

14
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Tumbling through history

15
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Like someone once said

16
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The answer is blowin' in the wind

17
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
How many times must our turned-away faces be struck

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Before we stop pretending not to notice?

19
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,000
How much suffering must we endure

20
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Before a smile can be free?

21
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Bound by rusted chains

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
If we run away with our tails between our legs again

23
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Like someone once said

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
The answer is blowin' in the wind

25
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
With a voice strained to its limit

26
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
And with tightly clenched hands

27
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Destiny is surely waiting for its time to change

28
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,000
With the modest power of a tiny love

29
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Sorrow is always

30
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Waiting to be held

31
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Rearranging a puzzle of lies

32
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Pitiful swindlers

33
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Clumsily acting skillful

34
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Foolish romanticists

35
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,000
A premonition of a day coming

36
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:15,000
When history falls silent

37
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Like someone once said

38
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:23,000
The answer is blowin' in the wind

39
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,000
With a voice strained to its limit

40
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:30,000
And with tightly clenched hands

41
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:37,000
Destiny is surely waiting for its time to change

42
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,000
With the modest power of a tiny love

43
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Sorrow is always

